slush, heavy snow.',1),(26,'CrossClimate 2','https://aecbmesvcm.cloudimg.io/v7/https://dcadprod.azureedge.net/b2c-experience-production/attachments/ckkmsgpml05d701lmzqb4uafu-4w-461-3528704918591-tire-michelin-crossclimate-2-215-slash-55-r17-94v-nl-a-main-1-30.png?w=190&org_if_sml=1&func=boundmin&ci_info=','Proven All-Season Performance Made to Last',1),(27,'Defender T + H','https://aecbmesvcm.cloudimg.io/v7/https://dcadprod.azureedge.net/b2c-experience-production/attachments/ckkm4wcae00f701oxg7tbh4gg-defender-th1q.png?w=190&org_if_sml=1&func=boundmin&ci_info=','More miles. With the safety you expect. Designed for the doers, Michelin\'s longest-lasting tire keeps you on the go longer - because life never stops moving.',1),(28,'Defender 2','https://aecbmesvcm.cloudimg.io/v7/https://dcadprod.azureedge.net/b2c-experience-production/attachments/cl1z3amx70m7h01ifyfpq72e9-defender-2-1q-lft-5i-si.png?w=190&org_if_sml=1&func=boundmin&ci_info=','The MICHELIN® Defender®2 tire outlasted three leading competitive tires by more than 25,000 miles on a treadwear test, delivering 2 extra years of treadlife.',1),(29,'Energy LX4','https://aecbmesvcm.cloudimg.io/v7/https://dcadprod.azureedge.net/b2c-experience-production/attachments/ckkm52ai300kk01of3ah6rkha-eg-lx41q.png?w=190&org_if_sml=1&func=boundmin&ci_info=','This original equipment passenger car tire offers superb fuel efficiency and a quiet, comfortable ride for vehicles like the Honda Odyssey, Lincoln Town Car and Chevrolet Malibu.',1),(30,'Energy Saver','https://aecbmesvcm.cloudimg.io/v7/https://dcadprod.azureedge.net/b2c-experience-production/attachments/ckkm5di2500or01ofqbtro8u0-eg-as1q.png?w=190&org_if_sml=1&func=boundmin&ci_info=','Our ultimate fuel-efficient passenger car tire is ideally suited for drivers looking to maximize fuel economy without compromising long treadlife and all season safety.',1),(31,'Pilot MXM4','https://aecbmesvcm.cloudimg.io/v7/https://dcadprod.azureedge.net/b2c-experience-production/attachments/ck