CrossContact LX 2','https://blobs.continental-tires.com/www8/servlet/blob/6698/4f408ec310fc482252a9861c95e55dce/conticrosscontact-lx2-tire-image-data.png','Excelent handling in the road and light off-road use.',2),(51,'CrossContact Rx','https://blobs.continental-tires.com/www8/servlet/blob/2936314/d6150f24d506785ba80d6ea4e4db9d2b/crosscontact-rx-tire-image-data.png','Substantial road noise reduction for a smooth and quiet everyday ride.',2),(52,'Conti4x4SportContact','https://blobs.continental-tires.com/www8/servlet/blob/6434/34a304ab277bc2c0dbaa4429023678cb/conti4x4sportcontact-tire-image-data.png','For comfortable driving on the road.',2),(53,'ContiCrossContact UHP','https://blobs.continental-tires.com/www8/servlet/blob/6864/cf889dff94c495d37e5710a395500c94/conticrosscontact-uhp-tire-image-data.png','For high speeds in use on roads.',2),(54,'ContiCrossContact LX Sport','https://blobs.continental-tires.com/www8/servlet/blob/6810/9757b7603494f32b421e7329f5d7f5e0/conticrosscontact-lx-sport-tire-image-data.png','High performance tire for road and easy terrain.',2),(55,'WinterContact TS 870 P','https://blobs.continental-tires.com/www8/servlet/image/3764254/uncropped/0/395/2/wintercontact-ts870p-30gradansicht.png','No season combines so many different weather conditions as winter does. Nevertheless, we want you to reliably master all of them. The new WinterContact™ TS 870 P is equipped with an improved sipe and pattern concept, which gives you excellent grip on snow and ice. At the same time, a new composition of our CoolChili™ compound enables an optimised wet performance, extra-low rolling resistance and high mileage, to make you enjoy a safe winter ride at any time – under any conditions.',2),(56,'WinterContact TS 870','https://blobs.continental-tires.com/www8/servlet/blob/3295094/c5d26987f4df1816870c9decfb2f58f6/wintercontact-ts-870-tire-image-main-30-data.png','With the invention of the first tyre with a tread-design in 1904, we created the basis for today’s tyre technology. Since then we have constantly improved the performance of our tyres from year to year. And although you probably won’t see the difference, you will definitely experience what makes the new WinterContact so outstanding.',2),(57,'ContiWinterContact TS 850','https://blobs.continental-tires.com/www8/servlet/blob/4990/14458bd15bf49b8846cb2e93b4b799ce/contiwintercontact-ts-850-tire-image-data.png','The perfect tyre for cold and wet weather conditions.',2),(58,'WinterContact TS 860','https://blobs.continental-tires.com/www8/servlet/blob/813894/bfc21927e64b3045fb1f93cdacab6177/wintercontact-ts-860-tire-image-data.png','German engineered safety to master any kind of winter.',2),(59,'WinterContact TS 860 S','https://blobs.continental-tires.com/www8/servlet/blob/2020498/e5a6e6d5f3158e6b6810daef1163dd0b/wintercontact-ts-860s-tire-image-data.png','Winter sport never felt that moving.',2),(60,'ContiWinterContact TS 830 P','https://blobs.continental-tires.com/www8/servlet/blob/5006/5c2f5d9cb573127a9614a85ec7319ca7/contiwintercontact-ts-830-p-tire-image-data.png','Winter Safety for high performance vehicles.',2),(61,'ContiWinterContact TS 830','https://blobs.continental-tires.com/www8/servlet/blob/30404/648988717bb3c997b0bc4f10999d60fb/contiwintercontact-ts-830-tire-image-data.png','Tailor-made braking specialist for compact and midrange cars.',2),(62,'ContiWinterContact TS 810 Sport','https://blobs.continental-tires.com/www8/servlet/blob/4922/effe24971a2e586cbc1ebf059f3920e1/contiwintercontact-ts-810-sport-tire-image-data.png','The sporty winter tire for powerful medium and luxury-class cars.',2),(63,'ContiWinterContact TS 810','https://blobs.continental-tires.com/www8/servlet/blob/30190/fac42434e23744a9e605d6e580a5b9ba/contiwintercontact-ts-810-tire-image-data.png','The comfortable winter tire for medium and luxury-class cars.',2),(64,'VikingContact 7','https://blobs.continental-tires.com/www8/servlet/blob/2369886/64c0828dab2938ec234348fd9342c7af/vikingcontact-7-tire-image-data.png','Not just another winter. Not just another tire.',2),(65,'ContiVikingContact 6','https://blobs.continental-tires.com/www8/servlet/blob/547782/641462734a0a868fb006d8b91997b737/contivikingcontact-6-tire-image-data.png','See winter in a new light.',2),(66,'IceContact 2','https://blobs.continental-tires.com/www8/servlet/blob/545386/fc9cb6488a3c6d197d49df48b36fe7b0/icecontact-2-tire-image-data.png','Meet winter’s safest player.',2),(67,'Conti4x4WinterContact','https://blobs.continental-tires.com/www8/servlet/blob/6506/6e3cdf1ecc4ca88a8104a5d68bfe6a9f/conti4x4wintercontact-tire-image-data.png','Built stronger than winter.',2),(68,'IceContact 3','https://blobs.continental-tires.com/www8/servlet/image/2872276/uncropped/0/395/9/icecontact-3-product-pic-16-30grad.png','It’s easier to relax with a tire you trust.',2),(69,'ContiCrossContact Winter','https://blobs.continental-tires.com/www8/servlet/blob/6744/c9b41c57bf3b867f5194c3e09364b999/conticrosscontact-winter-tire-image-data.png','Four times more control for every road and winter.',2),(70,'AllSeasonContact','https://blobs.continental-tires.com/www8/servlet/blob/1775028/f1bc08df5eb6fda23daf65eae2ab7d37/allseasoncontact-tire-image-data.png','Be in control of every season.',2),(71,'ADVAN A052','https://ytc-bm.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/ADVAN-APEX-V601-3QL-WEB.png?mtime=20201218213620&focal=none','Ultra-high performance cars demand an ultra-high performance tire. The ADVAN Apex® is our Y-rated ultra-high performance street tire designed to re-define grip and dominate U.S. roads. Available in today’s popular bigger sizes for a bigger dose of performance on the street, this is a tire that doesn’t just demand respect, it’s earned it.\n',3),(72,'ADVAN Apex','https://ytc-bm.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/ADVAN-APEX-V601-3QL-WEB.png?mtime=20201218213620&focal=none','Ultra-high performance cars demand an ultra-high performance tire. The ADVAN Apex® is our Y-rated ultra-high performance street tire designed to re-define grip and dominate U.S. roads. Available in today’s popular bigger sizes for a bigger dose of performance on the street, this is a tire that doesn’t just demand respect, it’s earned it.',3),(73,'ADVAN FLEVA® V701','https://ytc-bm.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/2009_YTC_CONS-ADVAN-Fleva-3QL-Web_2020-12-19-060856.png?mtime=20201218220858&focal=none','Give your car the efficient performance it demands with our ADVAN Fleva V701. With an aggressive tread design and road-hugging silica-infused compound, this high-performance summer tire handles wet and dry conditions like a pro.',3),(74,'ADVAN NEOVA AD08R','https://ytc-bm.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/ADVAN-NEOVA-AD08R-3QL-Web.png?mtime=20201218201419&focal=none','When the road or track calls for an extreme performance summer tire, the ADVAN Neova AD08R answers with world-class technology that delivers fistfuls of grip for unprecedented and consistent performance.',3),(75,'ADVAN SPORT V105','https://ytc-bm.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/2009_YTC_CONS-ADVAN-Sport-V105-3QL-Web_2020-12-19-061110.png?mtime=20201218221114&focal=none','For those who demand the best from their sports cars and performance sedans, the ADVAN Sport V105 delivers. With maximum grip in both wet and dry conditions, a quiet ride and long tread life, this is a global prestige sport tire you can trust to do it all.',3),(76,'ADVAN SPORT® ZPS','https://ytc-bm.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/2009_YTC_CONS-ADVAN-Sport-ZPS-3QL-Web_2020-12-19-061359.png?mtime=20201218221401&focal=none','The ADVAN Sport ZPS is an ultimate high-performance run flat tire that delivers competitive grip, wet traction and a long tread life, along with the ability to maintain performance and stability with a total loss of air pressure for up to 50 miles at 50 mph.',3),(77,'BluEarth Winter V905','https://ytc-bm.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/BluEarth-Winter-V905-3QL-Web.png?mtime=20201218223912&focal=none','The BluEarth Winter V905 is a high-traction winter tire that performs best when conditions are at their worst. With its increased edge effect and all-new compound, this tire will give you the confidence to take on everything winter throws your way.',3),(78,'BluEarth WINTER V906','https://ytc-bm.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/WEB-BlueEarth-Winter-V906-3QL.png?mtime=20220203152705&focal=none','The V- & W- speed rated BluEarth WINTER® V906 is Yokohama’s all-new winter performance tire for passenger cars. You will appreciate the confident snow, ice and wet performance as well as the dry road handling and longer tread life.',3),(79,'IceGUARD iG52c','https://ytc-bm.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/iceGUARD-iG52C-3QL-Web.png?mtime=20201218224253&focal=none','Experience exceptional performance and stability on winter roads with the iceGUARD iG52c. Our triple-action compound adapts to wet, dry, and ice conditions for a sense of complete confidence on all winter roads.',3),(80,'IceGUARD iG53 ','https://ytc-bm.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/iceGUARD-iG53-3QL-Web.png?mtime=20201218224404&focal=none','Engineered for peak performance on ice and snow, the iceGUARD iG53 studless winter tire incorporates advanced technology and an innovative tread design so you can handle the worst that winter has to offer with confidence.',3),(81,'BluEarth Winter V906','https://ytc-bm.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/WEB-BlueEarth-Winter-V906-SUV-3QL.png?mtime=20220210112156&focal=none','The V- & W- speed rated BluEarth WINTER® V906 SUV is Yokohama’s all-new winter performance tire for CUVs and SUVs. You will appreciate the confident snow, ice and wet performance as well as the dry road handling and longer tread life.',3),(82,'IceGUARD G075','https://ytc-bm.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/iceGuard-G075-3QL-Web.png?mtime=20210108195927&focal=none','The V- & W- speed rated BluEarth WINTER® V906 SUV is Yokohama’s all-new winter performance tire for CUVs and SUVs. You will appreciate the confident snow, ice and wet performance as well as the dry road handling and longer tread life.',3),(83,'IceGUARD IG51v','https://ytc-bm.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/iceGUARD-iG51v-3QL-Web.png?mtime=20201218224110&focal=none','When winter calls, answer it with the Yokohama iceGUARD iG51v. It’s designed to deliver durability and handling to your crossover, SUV or truck in winter conditions and packed with features to pack and expel slush and snow.',3),(84,'ADVAN Sport A/S+','https://ytc-bm.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/ADVAN-Sport-A-S-3QL-Web.png?mtime=20201218215425&focal=none','The best in all-season performance just got better. The ADVAN Sport A/S+ is an all-season tire specifically engineered to deliver long wear and ultra-high performance at every turn.',3),(85,'AVID Ascend GT','https://ytc-bm.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/AVID-Ascend-GT-3QL-Web.png?mtime=20201218222347&focal=none','The AVID Ascend GT is ready for anything. With all-season traction that performs even in the wet and snow, a quiet ride and long tread life, this premium grand touring tire delivers year-round performance in all kinds of weather.',3),(86,'AVID Ascend LX','https://ytc-bm.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/AVID-ASCEND-LX-3QL-WEB_2020-12-19-054806.png?mtime=20201218214808&focal=none','Providing exceptional mileage and grip, the AVID Ascend LX is our premium, high-mileage touring all-season tire engineered to deliver a quiet ride and long-term reliability, so you can go the distance.',3),(87,'AVID ENVigor ZPS','https://ytc-bm.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/AVID-ENVigor-ZPS-3QL-Web.png?mtime=20201218222640&focal=none','The AVID ENVigor ZPS all-season run flat gives you confident performance in all conditions, and can maintain that performance and stability for up to 50 miles at 50 mph with no air pressure. It’s a tire you can trust to get you there and back, mile after mile.',3),(88,'AVID Touring-S','https://ytc-bm.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/AVID-Touring-S-3QL-Web.png?mtime=20201218222900&focal=none','If you’re looking for a well-rounded touring tire that does it all, the AVID Touring-S delivers. With exceptional ride quality, stability and wet and dry traction, this all-season tire performs in all conditions, all year round, on all kinds of passenger vehicles.',3),(89,'Tornante','https://ytc-bm.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/Tornante-3QL-Web.png?mtime=20201218233102&focal=none','When it comes to long-lasting performance, the Tornante is an all-season touring tire that delivers mile after mile. Built with an advanced compound and tread design, it delivers long tread life and confident all-season handling and grip.',3),(90,'GEOLANDAR A/T G015','https://ytc-bm.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/GEOLANDAR-A-T-G015-LT-3QL-Web.png?mtime=20201218225019&focal=none','When the road ends, the fun begins. The GEOLANDAR A/T G015 is the ideal all-terrain tire for all weather conditions, delivering a perfect blend of on- and off-road performance, capability and comfort for drivers of today’s light trucks and SUVs.',3),(91,'GEOLANDAR H/T G056','https://ytc-bm.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/GEOLANDAR-H-T-G056-3QL-Web.png?mtime=20201218230500&focal=none','Hit the highway with confidence with the GEOLANDAR H/T G056. This all-season performer delivers confidence for the long haul, with an unbeatable combination of a quiet ride, all-season traction, long tread life and sturdy on-road durability.',3),(92,'GEOLANDAR M/T G003','https://ytc-bm.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/GEOLANDAR-M-T-G003-3QL-Web.png?mtime=20201218230624&focal=none','Conquering the off road is as much about conquering your fears as it is the terrain. The GEOLANDAR M/T G003 is engineered with rock-solid technologies providing crushing performance, intimidating looks, and outstanding tread life.',3),(93,'GEOLANDAR X-AT','https://ytc-bm.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/GEOLANDAR-X-AT-3QL-Web.png?mtime=20201218230805&focal=none','The GEOLANDAR X-AT is built to conquer serious off-road terrain without compromising on-road comfort. And with a 45,000-Mile Limited Treadwear Warranty, the GEOLANDAR X-AT provides extreme versatility so you can go farther with confidence.',3),(94,'GEOLANDAR X-MT','https://ytc-bm.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/GEOLANDAR-X-MT-3QL-Web.png?mtime=20201218232505&focal=none','Engineered for today\'s hardcore rock-crawlers, the GEOLANDAR X-MT demands respect on any trail, delivering relentless off-road grip, ruthless performance and the strength to get you to the top — and keep you there.',3),(95,'PARADA Spec-X','https://ytc-bm.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/Parada-Spec-X-3QL-Web.png?mtime=20201218232856&focal=none','The PARADA Spec-X is designed to handle anything that crosses its path. It delivers superior handling and wet traction capability and its advanced construction provides a quieter ride and longer tread life for performance in all conditions.',3),(96,'Eagle F1 Asymmetric 6','https://www.goodyear.eu/content/dam/common/tires/goodyear/consumer/eagf1as6/eagf1as6-normal.jpg.transform/small-mobile/image.jpg','Ready for Anything. Ultra-High Performance for wet & dry roads.',4),(97,'EfficientGrip Performance 2','https://www.goodyear.eu/content/dam/common/tires/goodyear/consumer/effigripp2/effigripp2-normal.jpg.transform/small-mobile/image.jpg','Get 50% more kilometers, Goodyear takes you further*',4),(98,'Eagle F1 SuperSport','https://www.goodyear.eu/content/dam/common/tires/goodyear/consumer/eagf1supsp/eagf1supsp-normal.jpg.transform/small-mobile/image.jpg','A race inspired tyre for superior grip and handling on dry roads',4),(99,'Eagle F1 SuperSport R','https://www.goodyear.eu/content/dam/common/tires/goodyear/consumer/eaf1supspr/eaf1supspr-normal.jpg.transform/small-mobile/image.jpg','Exceptional grip and steering precision on dry surfaces, on and off track.',4),(100,'Eagle F1 SuperSport RS','https://www.goodyear.eu/content/dam/common/tires/goodyear/consumer/eaf1susprs/eaf1susprs-normal.jpg.transform/small-mobile/image.jpg','A track ready tyre with exhilarating performance on dry surfaces.',4),(101,'Eagle F1 Asymmetric 3','https://www.goodyear.eu/content/dam/common/tires/goodyear/consumer/eagf1as3/eagf1as3-normal.jpg.transform/small-mobile/image.jpg','Short braking distances on wet and dry roads for optimal control.',4),(102,'Eagle F1 Asymmetric 2','https://www.goodyear.eu/content/dam/common/tires/goodyear/consumer/duragrip/duragrip-normal.jpg.transform/small-mobile/image.jpg','The ultra high-performance tyre that delivers shorter braking distances when it matters most',4),(103,'DuraGrip','https://www.goodyear.eu/content/dam/common/tires/goodyear/consumer/duragrip/duragrip-normal.jpg.transform/small-mobile/image.jpg','The long-lasting tyre that helps your van save fuel',4),(104,'Eagle F1 Asymmetric 5','https://www.goodyear.eu/content/dam/common/tires/goodyear/consumer/eagf1as5/eagf1as5-normal.jpg.transform/small-mobile/image.jpg','Luxurious comfort with a strong braking & handling performance on wet.',4),(105,'EfficientGrip Performance','https://www.goodyear.eu/content/dam/common/tires/goodyear/consumer/effigrippe/effigrippe-normal.jpg.transform/small-mobile/image.jpg','The tyre with improved grip and shorter braking distances on wet roads',4),(106,'EfficientGrip','https://www.goodyear.eu/content/dam/common/tires/goodyear/consumer/effigrip/effigrip-normal.jpg.transform/small-mobile/image.jpg','The fuel-saving tyre that keeps performing for longer',4),(107,'Excellence','https://www.goodyear.eu/content/dam/common/tires/goodyear/consumer/excellence/excellence-normal.jpg.transform/small-mobile/image.jpg','The three-in-one tyre that delivers superb grip, handling and comfort.',4),(108,'Eagle LS-2','https://www.goodyear.eu/content/dam/common/tires/goodyear/consumer/eagls2/eagls2-normal.jpg.transform/small-mobile/image.jpg','A quality performance tyre for a smooth, quiet ride and confident cornering in any season.',4),(109,'Eagle Sport All Season','https://www.goodyear.eu/content/dam/common/tires/goodyear/consumer/eagsptas/eagsptas-normal.jpg.transform/small-mobile/image.jpg','A sport performance all-season tire',4),(110,'Eagle Touring','https://www.goodyear.eu/content/dam/common/tires/goodyear/consumer/eagtouring/eagtouring-normal.jpg.transform/small-mobile/image.jpg','Confident handling and a smooth, quiet ride for luxury performance.',4),(111,'EfficientGrip 2 SUV','https://www.goodyear.eu/content/dam/common/tires/goodyear/consumer/effigrip2s/effigrip2s-normal.jpg.transform/small-mobile/image.jpg','Get 25% more mileage, Goodyear takes you further*',4),(112,'Vector 4Seasons Gen-2','https://www.goodyear.eu/content/dam/common/tires/goodyear/consumer/vec4seasg2/vec4seasg2-normal.jpg.transform/small-mobile/image.jpg','Excellent driving performance in all weather conditions all year long',4),(113,'Vector 4Seasons Gen-3','https://www.goodyear.eu/content/dam/common/tires/goodyear/consumer/vec4seasg3/vec4seasg3-normal.jpg.transform/small-mobile/image.jpg','Excellent wet, dry and snow performance.',4),(114,'Vector 4Seasons','https://www.goodyear.eu/content/dam/common/tires/goodyear/consumer/vec4season/vec4season-normal.jpg.transform/small-mobile/image.jpg','Exceptional performance, all year round',4),(115,'Vector 4Seasons Gen-3 SUV','https://www.goodyear.eu/content/dam/common/tires/goodyear/consumer/vec4sg3suv/vec4sg3suv-normal.jpg.transform/small-mobile/image.jpg','Excellent wet, dry and snow performance for SUVs',4),(116,'Vector 4Seasons SUV Gen-2','https://www.goodyear.eu/content/dam/common/tires/goodyear/consumer/vec4ssuvg2/vec4ssuvg2-normal.jpg.transform/small-mobile/image.jpg','Excellent SUV driving performance with one set of tyres',4),(117,'Vector 4Seasons SUV Gen-1','https://www.goodyear.eu/content/dam/common/tires/goodyear/consumer/vec4seasuv/vec4seasuv-normal.jpg.transform/small-mobile/image.jpg','The all-season SUV tyre that adapts to the weather – for performance all year round',4),(118,'POTENZA SPORT','https://www.bridgestonetire.com/content/dam/consumer/bst/shared/tires/potenza-sport/tilted.jpg','Engineered to empower drivers, the Potenza Sport high performance summer tires let you take control of the track. Whether the conditions are damp or you’re taking curves at high speeds, these tires offer an exhilarating experience.',5),(119,'POTENZA SPORT','https://www.bridgestonetire.com/content/dam/consumer/bst/shared/tires/potenza-sport/tilted.jpg','Engineered to empower drivers, the Potenza Sport high performance summer tires let you take control of the track. Whether the conditions are damp or you’re taking curves at high speeds, these tires offer an exhilarating experience.',5),(120,'POTENZA S007A RFT','https://www.bridgestonetire.com/content/dam/consumer/bst/shared/tires/potenza-s007a-rft/tilted.jpg','Take your sports car for a spin with more power from the Potenza S007A RFT. These tires will elevate your experience with higher contact pressure of the tire to the road for better braking in wet conditions. Engineered for a thrilling ride, the tread pattern allows greater stability and control during cornering and also offers excellent responsiveness.',5),(121,'POTENZA RE-71R','https://www.bridgestonetire.com/content/dam/consumer/bst/shared/tires/potenza-re-71r/tilted.jpg','Take advantage of the road with tire technology inspired by racing. Focused on maximum grip when breaking and cornering, the Potenza RE-71R tires are ideal when hitting the road or the track.',5),(122,'DUELER H/P SPORT','https://www.bridgestonetire.com/content/dam/consumer/bst/shared/tires/dueler-hp-sport/tilted.jpg','Take the performance of your Sport Truck or SUV to the next level with Dueler H/P Sport tires. These tires were designed around high-performance standards and the ability to drive with confidence in wet and dry conditions.',5),(123,'BLIZZAK LM-32','https://www.bridgestonetire.com/content/dam/consumer/bst/shared/tires/blizzak-lm-32/tilted.jpg','The Blizzak LM-32 winter tire gives luxury vehicles the ability to perform comfortably on snow and ice covered roads. With dependable cornering, handling, and impressive grip you can confidently take your luxury vehicle out to show winter weather who‚Äôs boss.',5),(124,'BLIZZAK LM001','https://www.bridgestonetire.com/content/dam/consumer/bst/shared/tires/blizzak-lm001/tilted.jpg','Whether the roads are wet, dry, icy, slushy, or snowy, the Blizzak LM001 tires are the tires for the job. Developed for sedans and coupes, these tires offer an excellent performance in the winter with impressive grip and control.',5),(125,'BLIZZAK LM001 SUV','https://www.bridgestonetire.com/content/dam/consumer/bst/shared/tires/blizzak-lm001/tilted.jpg','Whether the roads are wet, dry, icy, slushy, or snowy, the Blizzak LM001 tires are the tires for the job. Developed for sedans and coupes, these tires offer an excellent performance in the winter with impressive grip and control.',5),(126,'BLIZZAK WS90','https://www.bridgestonetire.com/content/dam/consumer/bst/shared/tires/blizzak-ws90/tilted.jpg','Hit the snow, ice, and other harsh winter conditions with the leading tire in control on ice. *New tread compound with larger contact area helps improve performance on ice. The Blizzak WS90 tire offers you the confidence needed for winter driving with reliable stopping power and secure handling patented multicell ™ technology enhances road grip to help combat slippage on ice for your car or minivan.***This tire is built to get you through this winter with 30% more block stiffness and 30% more block stiffness in tread pattern for an extra season of wear.** Helps improve responsiveness and wear life in tread pattern for an extra season of wear***.',5),(127,'BLIZZAK LT','https://www.bridgestonetire.com/content/dam/bato-dam/na-us/tires/bridgestone/image-graphics/tire-images/tilted.jpg','Keep commercial light trucks and vans going all winter long with Blizzak LT tires. These tires are designed to give larger vehicles the ability to take on winter conditions with commercial-grade construction for reliable traction in snow, ice, and slush.',5),(128,'BLIZZAK DM-V2','https://www.bridgestonetire.com/content/dam/consumer/bst/shared/tires/blizzak-dm-v2/tilted.jpg','Engineered for many popular SUVs, CUVs, and light trucks, Blizzak DM-V2 tires let you grip the road confidently during the harsh winter months. When the winter weather is unpredictable, these tires give you the ability to navigate the ice and snow with improved braking power. Latest proprietary multicell ™ compound removes water from the surface of the tire for solid braking on ice. Advanced hydrophilic properties provides confident stopping power on snow and ice.',5),(129,'BLIZZAK W965','https://www.bridgestonetire.com/content/dam/consumer/bst/shared/tires/blizzak-w965/tilted.jpg','Give your commercial light truck or van the ability to navigate the winter roads with the Blizzak W965 tire. Both comfortable and durable, these tires give the traction you need to keep going in the unpredictable winter weather.',5),(130,'TURANZA QUIETTRACK','https://www.bridgestonetire.com/content/dam/consumer/bst/shared/tires/turanza-quiettrack/tilted.jpg','Take on the road with a quiet, comfortable ride with the Turanza QuietTrack touring tire. These impressive all-season tires deliver control in wet and snowy conditions and are built to last for up to 80,000 miles*. Designed to fit many of today’s most popular cars and sedans, the Turanza QuietTrack is engineered to impress.',5),(131,'WEATHERPEAK WEATHERPEAK','https://www.bridgestonetire.com/content/dam/consumer/bst/shared/tires/weatherpeak-weatherpeak/tilted.jpg','The next evolution of the all-season tire is here. The new WeatherPeak is designed with open shoulder slots for better grip and driving control in wet and dry conditions – giving you a smooth, quiet ride any time of the year. And it’s 3 Peak Mountain Snowflake Certified to offer improved winter braking power, stopping 30 feet shorter than the competition*. With WeatherPeak, you’ll enjoy every mile of your journey in complete comfort – with the confidence that a little rain or snow won’t slow you down.',5),(132,'ECOPIA EP422 PLUS','https://www.bridgestonetire.com/content/dam/consumer/bst/shared/tires/ecopia-ep422-plus/tilted.jpg','Engineered for some of today\'s most popular sedans and minivans, the Ecopia EP422 Plus tire allows you to take on the road with confidence. These durable all-season performance tires offer a 70,000 limited mileage warranty** while getting more miles per tank*. Fuel Saver ™ Sidewall & Tread Compound assists with rolling efficiency for fuel economy*.',5),(133,'DRIVEGUARD PLUS','https://www.bridgestonetire.com/content/dam/consumer/bst/shared/tires/driveguard-plus/tilted.jpg','Touring tire comfort meets all-season confidence in the DriveGuard Plus. With improved performance and extended mobility, the DriveGuard Plus gets you where you need to go safely. Its next-gen run-flat capabilities are good for up to 50 miles at up to 50 mph post-puncture*. Engineered with zero-degree draft angles, it has superior gripping powers to help you excel in all the elements—stopping 40 feet shorter in snow over the original DriveGuard. *Up to 50 miles at up to 50 mph. Repairability of DriveGuard tires depends on the tire damage, amount of pressure loss, and vehicle operating conditions.',5),(134,'DRIVEGUARD DRIVEGUARD','https://www.bridgestonetire.com/content/dam/consumer/bst/shared/tires/driveguard-driveguard/tilted.jpg','The impressive Bridgestone DriveGuard tire was engineered to allow you to drive up to 50 miles at a maximum speed of 50 mph after a puncture*. This tire also delivers a comfortable performance on both wet and dry surfaces.',5),(135,'POTENZA RE980AS','https://www.bridgestonetire.com/content/dam/consumer/bst/shared/tires/potenza-re980as/tilted.jpg','Armed with the technology to deliver precise handling and response control, the Potenza RE980AS tires are engineered for drivers of performance and luxury vehicles. Optimized for crisp handling and taking curves in any weather, these tires are both impressive and thrilling on the road.',5),(136,'POTENZA RE980AS PLUS','https://www.bridgestonetire.com/content/dam/consumer/bst/shared/tires/potenza-re980as-plus/tilted.jpg','Who said high performance driving was only for the summer? Built with all-season capabilities, these tires give you intense stopping power in the winter plus grip and handling in both wet and dry conditions.',5),(137,'ALENZA AS ULTRA','https://www.bridgestonetire.com/content/dam/consumer/bst/shared/tires/alenza-as-ultra/tilted.jpg','Unlock the full potential of your premium vehicle with the all new Bridgestone Alenza AS Ultra. These tires deliver an excellent balance of wet, winter and wear performance—plus the comfort that defines the Alenza product family. The improved braking performance means stops are 14 feet shorter on dry roads and 10% shorter in snow. QuietTrack™ technology also creates a quiet and all-around comfortable driving experience. With over 49 sizes to cover most new and popular vehicles, the Alenza AS Ultra tire pairs an exceptionally long tread life with a luxury driving experience to create Bridgestone’s most premium SUV, CUV and truck tire yet.',5),(138,'ECOPIA H/L 422 PLUS','https://www.bridgestonetire.com/content/dam/consumer/bst/shared/tires/ecopia-hl-422-plus/tilted.jpg','Take on the road with a quiet, comfortable ride with the Turanza QuietTrack touring tire. These impressive all-season tires deliver control in wet and snowy conditions and are built to last for up to 80,000 miles*. Designed to fit many of today’s most popular cars and sedans, the Turanza QuietTrack is engineered to impress.',5),(139,'DUELER H/L ALENZA PLUS','https://www.bridgestonetire.com/content/dam/consumer/bst/shared/tires/dueler-hl-alenza-plus/tilted.jpg','Designed to deliver year-round performance, the Dueler H/L Alenza Plus tires offer a quiet and comfortable highway ride with an up to 80,000 mile limited warranty†. With a long tread life and improved fuel efficiency, Advanced Tread Polymer Technology provides impressive wear performance backed by up to an 80,000 mile limited warranty*. With a fuel efficient tread compound promoting rolling efficiency, Dueler H/L Alenza Plus tires are built to last.',5),(140,'DUELER H/L ALENZA','https://www.bridgestonetire.com/content/dam/consumer/bst/shared/tires/dueler-hl-alenza/tilted.jpg','Take on the terrain with Dueler H/L Alenza tires. Designed to give your truck, SUV, or CUV a comfortable and confident ride on both wet and dry surfaces, the Dueler H/L Alenza tires are armed with the technologies for a durable tread life.',5),(141,'DUELER H/T 684 II','https://www.bridgestonetire.com/content/dam/consumer/bst/shared/tires/dueler-ht-684-ii/tilted.jpg','With a 60,000 mile limited warranty*, the Dueler H/T 684 II tires let you take on many adventures with comfort. These all-season performance tires give impressive traction on both wet and dry surfaces.',5),(142,'DUELER H/T 685','https://www.bridgestonetire.com/content/dam/consumer/bst/shared/tires/dueler-ht-685/tilted.jpg','Give your truck heavy-duty performance year after year with technologies engineered around confident traction on wet and dry surfaces with the Dueler H/T 685 tires.',5),(143,'Discoverer Snow Claw','https://coopertire.com/CooperTire/media/TireImages/Snow-Claw-RL-FINAl.webp?ext=.webp','Built for impressive performance in snow',6),(144,'Discoverer True North','https://coopertire.com/CooperTire/media/TireImages/Discoverer-True-North-RL.webp?ext=.webp','Studdable for improved ice traction',6),(145,'CS5 Grand Touring','https://coopertire.com/CooperTire/media/TireImages/CS5-Grand-Touring-BLK-RL.webp?ext=.webp','All-season traction to keep you confident in tough weather',6),(146,'CS5 Ultra Touring','https://coopertire.com/CooperTire/media/TireImages/CS5-Ultra-Touring-BLK-RL.webp?ext=.webp','Designed for a smooth ride so quiet you can focus on the drive',6),(147,'Cooper Endeavor','https://coopertire.com/CooperTire/media/TireImages/Endeavor-RL1.webp?ext=.webp','Balanced performance for greater grip in wet and snowy conditions',6),(148,'Discoverer Rugged Trek','https://coopertire.com/CooperTire/media/TireImages/Rugged-Trek1-RL-FINAL.webp?ext=.webp','Aggressive tread design offers a tough look',6),(149,'Discoverer AT3 4S','https://coopertire.com/CooperTire/media/TireImages/Discoverer-AT3-4S-BLK-RL.webp?ext=.webp','Keep confident on wet roads with maximum grip and handling',6),(150,'Discoverer SRX','https://coopertire.com/CooperTire/media/TireImages/Disco-SRX-BLK-RL.webp?ext=.webp','Maximum ride comfort feels like luxury on wheels',6),(151,'Endeavor Plus','https://coopertire.com/CooperTire/media/TireImages/Endeavor-Plus-RL1.webp?ext=.webp','Balanced performance for greater grip in wet and snowy conditions',6),(152,'EnduraMax','https://coopertire.com/CooperTire/media/TireImages/Enduramax-RL-FINAL.webp?ext=.webp','A smooth and quiet ride that keeps you comfortable on rough roads',6),(153,'P ZERO NERO GT','https://www.pirelli.com/tyres/car/dynamic/assets/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fd3nv2arudvw7ln.cloudfront.net%2Fimages%2Fglobal%2F990%2F232%2Fpzero-nero-3-4-1505470088560.jpg&w=1920&q=75','P ZERO™ NERO GT is the UHP tyre for consumers who want to fit Pirelli on their medium-large sedans and sporty cars. Materials and tread design have been optimised, the compound has a balanced content of silica in order to enhance wear resistance without compromising the sportive feeling of the product in both dry and wet conditions.',7),(154,'P ZERO ROSSO','https://www.pirelli.com/tyres/car/dynamic/assets/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fd3nv2arudvw7ln.cloudfront.net%2Fimages%2Fglobal%2F267%2F387%2FPZero-Rosso-3-4-1505470088712.jpg&w=1920&q=75','Enginereed to match with all the electronic traction and stability control systems, P ZERO™ ROSSO is the ideal choice for sports on vehicles with medium-high displacement. The perfect balance between performance and comfort thanks to an exemplary steering precision on dry and wet.',7),(155,'P ZERO CORSA SYSTEM','https://www.pirelli.com/tyres/car/dynamic/assets/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fd3nv2arudvw7ln.cloudfront.net%2Fimages%2Fglobal%2F546%2F946%2FP-zero-corsa-system-3-4-1505470088408.jpg&w=1920&q=75','P ZERO™ CORSA SYSTEM is the most sporting tyre in the road car range. Developed by Pirelli together with supercar manufacturers for both road and track use, on models directly derived from their motorsport counterparts. P ZERO™ CORSA SYSTEM concept combines directional (front axle fitment) and asymmetric (rear axle fitment or all-round application) to enhance not only performance, but also styling. The specialised structure of this tyre gives it optimal stability at high speed and while cornering. The directional tread pattern (for the front) incorporates longitudinal grooves that expel water from the contact patch, benefitting steering precision. The asymmetric design (for the rear) improves the handling, thanks to an ample contact patch and increased rigidity.',7),(156,'P ZERO CORSA (PZC4)','https://www.pirelli.com/tyres/car/dynamic/assets/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fd3nv2arudvw7ln.cloudfront.net%2Fimages%2Fglobal%2F589%2F818%2Fpzero-corsa-3-4-1505470090635.jpg&w=1920&q=75','The P ZERO™ CORSA (PZC4) is a tyre that brings the best of motorsport technology both on the road and on tracks. Developed in association with leading vehicle manufacturers in the high performance sector, it is perfect in every road surface. The racing type compounds allow to achieve an extreme handling and best levels of braking and traction',7),(157,'P ZERO','https://www.pirelli.com/tyres/car/dynamic/assets/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fd3nv2arudvw7ln.cloudfront.net%2Fimages%2Fglobal%2F472%2F732%2Fpzero-vecchio-3-4-1505470066413.jpg&w=1920&q=75','A milestone in the development of the Pirelli range, P ZERO™ has been chosen as original equipment for the most performance oriented and powerful models on the market. Its asymmetric tread pattern improves braking performance and enhances handling and control. Excellent in wet conditions with improved safety in potential aquaplaning situations. Its new nano-composite compound ensures maximum grip and stability. The structural integrity of the tyre improves steering response, which is essential in sports driving, and also ensures uniform tread wear. The special “s-shaped” grooves in the tread area deliver lower cabin noise levels, enhancing driver comfort.',7),(158,'P ZERO (PZ4)','https://www.pirelli.com/tyres/car/dynamic/assets/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fd3nv2arudvw7ln.cloudfront.net%2Fimages%2Fglobal%2F891%2F563%2Fpzero-nuovo-3-4-1505470072726.jpg&w=1920&q=75','P ZERO™ (PZ4) is the unique Ultra High Performance product combining Pirelli\'s knowledge gained from competitive Motorsport with Pirelli\'s alliance with the top car manufacturers, granting the perfect fit for the performance of each car.\nP ZERO™ (PZ4) has a range developed with the most prestigious OEMs that is able to meet any customisation needs in terms of size, technology and seasonality.\nA milestone in the development of the Pirelli range, P ZERO™ (PZ4) has been chosen as original equipment for the most performance oriented and powerful models on the market. Its asymmetric tread pattern improves braking performance and enhances handling and control. Excellent in wet conditions with improved safety in potential aquaplaning situations. Its new nano-composite compound ensures maximum grip and stability. The structural integrity of the tyre improves steering response, which is essential in sports driving, and also ensures uniform tread wear. The special “s-shaped” grooves in the tread area deliver lower cabin noise levels, enhancing driver comfort.',7),(159,'SCORPION VERDE','https://www.pirelli.com/tyres/car/dynamic/assets/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fd3nv2arudvw7ln.cloudfront.net%2Fimages%2Fglobal%2F529%2F698%2Fscorpion-verde-3-4-1505470074533.jpg&w=1920&q=75','Tyre for SUVs and Crossovers, the SCORPION™ VERDE has been created to take advantage of most innovative materials, structures and tread patterns introduced by Pirelli. The low rolling resistance and reduced weight, ensure lower fuel consumption and CO2 emissions, thus combining savings, respect for the environment, comfort and safety on all road surfaces.',7),(160,'SCORPION','https://www.pirelli.com/tyres/car/dynamic/assets/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fd3nv2arudvw7ln.cloudfront.net%2Fimages%2Fglobal%2F542%2F227%2FSC-3-4-4505525112390.jpg&w=1920&q=75','New Scorpion™ is the latest Pirelli Summer high performance product for SUV application with a strong focus on wet performances, mileage, rolling resistance and driving comfort.',7),(161,'POWERGY','https://www.pirelli.com/tyres/car/dynamic/assets/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fd3nv2arudvw7ln.cloudfront.net%2Fimages%2Fglobal%2F802%2F375%2FPowergy-gallery-base-3-4-4505522086822.jpg&w=1920&q=75','NPowergy™ is the new Pirelli Summer line for cars and SUVs. It’s the smart choice for drivers looking for safety and green performance with a low environmental impact.\nWith high levels of wet grip (EU Label Wet Grip A Rating on full range) and braking, Powergy™ helps to provides precise handling in all road conditions and reduces the risk of aquaplaning.\nThe low rolling resistance ensures low fuel consumption and high levels of comfort.',7),(162,'P ZERO WINTER','https://www.pirelli.com/tyres/car/dynamic/assets/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fd3nv2arudvw7ln.cloudfront.net%2Fimages%2Fglobal%2F955%2F97%2Fpzero-winter-gallery-3-4-4505513390055.jpg&w=1920&q=75','Co-development with car makers, perfect fit and high performance have always been the core values of P ZERO™. Today this philosophy is available for the winter season as well. Introducing the new P ZERO™ WINTER allows high performance to enter the winter season, ensuring to enjoy the same driving experience both in summer with P ZERO™ and in winter with P ZERO™ WINTER.',7),(163,'WINTER SOTTOZERO 3','https://www.pirelli.com/tyres/car/dynamic/assets/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fd3nv2arudvw7ln.cloudfront.net%2Fimages%2Fglobal%2F334%2F9%2Fsottozero-serie-3-3-4-1505470076286.jpg&w=1920&q=75','WINTER SOTTOZERO™ 3 is the winter tyre dedicated to high-end premium vehicles. It has been designed taking into account the evolution of the modern vehicles, in order to achieve maximum safety, control and performance in all winter weather conditions. New compounds and new sipe design have been used introducing the latest technological features. Furthermore, WINTER SOTTOZERO™ 3 has been co-developed with premium and prestige OEMs.',7),(164,'WINTER SOTTOZERO SERIE II','https://www.pirelli.com/tyres/car/dynamic/assets/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fd3nv2arudvw7ln.cloudfront.net%2Fimages%2Fglobal%2F1005%2F329%2Fwinter-sottozero2-3-4-1505470083282.jpg&w=1920&q=75','The ideal choice for sports cars and top end vehicles, balancing performance, safety and respect for the environment. The asymmetric tread pattern is divided into two distinct elements. The inner area expels water effectively whilst the external area, with its more rigid and spaced blocks, ensures high levels of grip on snow. Characterised by a record number of homologations, this product is the choice of premium car manufactures as the best Winter Original Equipment product.',7),(165,'CINTURATO WINTER','https://www.pirelli.com/tyres/car/dynamic/assets/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fd3nv2arudvw7ln.cloudfront.net%2Fimages%2Fglobal%2F173%2F358%2Fcinturato-winter-3-4-1505470090407.jpg&w=1920&q=75','Developed to meet the needs of the European consumers in terms of safety and performance on all road surfaces, the new product completes Pirelli’s product portfolio in the Cinturato™ family. It represents the highest level of winter technology and it has been developed to achieve maximum safety and control in all winter conditions.',7),(166,'CINTURATO WINTER 2','https://www.pirelli.com/tyres/car/dynamic/assets/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fd3nv2arudvw7ln.cloudfront.net%2Fimages%2Fglobal%2F83%2F473%2FCinturato-winter-2-gallery-3-4-4505524623137.jpg&w=1920&q=75','Long lasting performance on snow throughout the life of the tyre thanks to the 3D sipes adaptive technology. In a new tyre the sipes are linear but when it gets worn they transform themselves assuming a zig-zag shape that ensures a constant grip and its ability to capture snow.',7),(167,'SCORPION WINTER','https://www.pirelli.com/tyres/car/dynamic/assets/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fd3nv2arudvw7ln.cloudfront.net%2Fimages%2Fglobal%2F410%2F757%2Fscorpion-winter-3-4-1505470067710.jpg&w=1920&q=75','SCORPION™ WINTER has been designed to fit modern SUVs with a special focus on the high-end segment and provides an important contribution to the drivers’ safety as it guarantees maximum stability and control in snow, wet and dry conditions. - Best in class on snow (braking, handling and traction); - Excellent braking and handling (in wet and dry conditions at low temperatures);- Lower noise and rolling resistance.',7),(168,'ICE ZERO FR','https://www.pirelli.com/tyres/car/dynamic/assets/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fd3nv2arudvw7ln.cloudfront.net%2Fimages%2Fglobal%2F1003%2F717%2Fice-zero-fr-3-4-1505470078099.jpg&w=1920&q=75','This is the ideal choice for those who drive in Nordic winter conditions looking for a high level of stability and control with a superior driving comfort. The ICE ZERO™ FR is the studless solution of the Pirelli ICE ZERO™ collection, performance and control at top level. Specifically developed for owners of city/medium cars, premium sedans and SUV. Featuring also Run Flat™ Technology.',7),(169,'ICE ZERO','https://www.pirelli.com/tyres/car/dynamic/assets/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fd3nv2arudvw7ln.cloudfront.net%2Fimages%2Fglobal%2F696%2F961%2Fice-zero-3-4-1505470077909.jpg&w=1920&q=75','The new generation of studded tyres, developed to increase ice performance in extreme winter conditions, whilst guaranteeing safety, control and performance. Wide size range from city to sporty cars and SUV, including Run Flat™ sizes. ICE ZERO™  is one of the best performers in the latest winter press tests.',7),(170,'CINTURATO ALL SEASON','https://www.pirelli.com/tyres/car/dynamic/assets/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fd3nv2arudvw7ln.cloudfront.net%2Fimages%2Fglobal%2F684%2F326%2F03cinturato-all-season-3-4-1505470090179.jpg&w=1920&q=75','The new European All Season product designed for drivers living in urban areas searching for an innovative and alternative mobility solution. CINTURATO™ ALL SEASON brings all the latest Pirelli premium technologies including Seal Inside™.',7),(171,'CINTURATO ALL SEASON PLUS','https://www.pirelli.com/tyres/car/dynamic/assets/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fd3nv2arudvw7ln.cloudfront.net%2Fimages%2Fglobal%2F40%2F81%2Fcinturato-all-season-plus-3-4-1505470067429.jpg&w=1920&q=75','CINTURATO™ ALL SEASON PLUS is the evolution of the current Cinturato™ All Season: enhanced product performance for drivers living in urban areas that are looking for an innovative and alternative mobility solution. The new tread pattern compound improves performance both in winter and summer condition, with a special focus on snow and wet, guaranteeing a safer drive.',7),(172,'CINTURATO™ ALL SEASON SF 2','https://www.pirelli.com/tyres/car/dynamic/assets/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fd3nv2arudvw7ln.cloudfront.net%2Fimages%2Fglobal%2F397%2F534%2FCinturato-All-Season-3-4-4505522000584.jpg&w=1920&q=75','New CINTURATO™ ALL SEASON SF 2 is the ideal choice for drivers who are looking for an innovative mobility solution. The new generation All Season 3 Peak Mountain Snowflake (3PMSF) product has been designed to achieve enhanced product performance in both urban and touring conditions, with a special focus on mileage and safety in all weather conditions. The 3PMSF marking guarantees perfect usability in both summer and winter, in compliance with the local legislation (where they apply), so you no longer have to worry about the seasonal tyre change. With CINTURATO™ ALL SEASON SF 2 you\'ll enjoy a premium, comfortable and safe driving experience all year. It’s also available (in selected sizes) with extended mobility technology: Seal Inside™ and Run Flat™.',7),(173,'PIRELLI SCORPION™ ALL SEASON SF2','https://www.pirelli.com/tyres/car/dynamic/assets/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fd3nv2arudvw7ln.cloudfront.net%2Fimages%2Fglobal%2F680%2F968%2FScorpion-AS-2-gallery-3-4-4505527506191.jpg&w=1920&q=75','New Scorpion™ All Season SF2 is the new Pirelli All Season 3PMSF line dedicated to SUVs.',7),(174,'SCORPION ATR','https://www.pirelli.com/tyres/car/dynamic/assets/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fd3nv2arudvw7ln.cloudfront.net%2Fimages%2Fglobal%2F747%2F1%2Fscorpion-ATR-3-4-1505470067539.jpg&w=1920&q=75','Off road it is tenacious and reliable. On road it provides comfort, excellent traction and resistance to wear. A versatile and safe tyre, the SCORPION™ ATR features a tread with a specific self-cleaning pattern. It facilitates the most demanding off-road driving and resists the hardest shocks on uneven surfaces. Once back on the road it provides safety when braking and whilst cornering. It delivers a high resistance to aquaplaning and low rolling noise, which enhances the acoustic comfort in the cabin. Excellent traction in all road conditions. Characterisation as an all terrain tyre, this is confirmed by its ability to provide a safe and controlled performance on the most diverse surfaces, from gravel to mud, it offers a reassuring grip. SCORPION™ ATR features the M+S marking engraved on the sidewall.',7),(175,'SCORPION™ VERDE ALL SEASON','https://www.pirelli.com/tyres/car/dynamic/assets/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fd3nv2arudvw7ln.cloudfront.net%2Fimages%2Fglobal%2F17%2F641%2Fscorpion-verde-all-season-3-4-1505470075906.jpg&w=1920&q=75','SCORPION™ VERDE ALL SEASON is a Pirelli’s Green Performance Crossover & SUV tyre that takes full advantage of the most modern resources, structures and tread patterns to guarantee savings, respect to the environment, comfort and safety on all road surfaces. The lateral stability and the traction on wet and light snow, ensure all season performances. SCORPION™ VERDE ALL SEASON features the M+S marking engraved on the sidewall.',7),(176,'SCORPION™ VERDE ALL SEASON SF','https://www.pirelli.com/tyres/car/dynamic/assets/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fd3nv2arudvw7ln.cloudfront.net%2Fimages%2Fglobal%2F122%2F607%2Fgallery-base-02-4505517221133.jpg&w=1920&q=75','SCORPION™ VERDE ALL SEASON SF is the latest product from Pirelli\'s Crossover & SUV tyre range that takes, as always, full advantage of the most modern materials to guarantee savings, whilst respecting the environment and providing comfort and safety on all road surfaces. The 3PMSF marking guarantees the highest level of certification for winter tyre use. In addition to the M+S marking, SCORPION™ VERDE ALL SEASON SF now features the 3PMSF marking imprinted on the sidewall. Effective performance and safe driving in non-severe winter conditions are ensured by excellent lateral stability and traction in both wet and snowy conditions.',7),(177,'SCORPION ZERO ASIMMETRICO','https://www.pirelli.com/tyres/car/dynamic/assets/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fd3nv2arudvw7ln.cloudfront.net%2Fimages%2Fglobal%2F578%2F376%2FScorpion-Zero-Asimmetrico-3-4-1505470076172.jpg&w=1920&q=75','The attractive tread pattern, the high level of grip and the precise steering response makes SCORPION™ ZERO ASIMMETRICO the ideal tyre for drivers seeking high/sporty performance on road and safe driving in off road conditions.',7),(178,'SCORPION ZERO ALL SEASON','https://www.pirelli.com/tyres/car/dynamic/assets/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fd3nv2arudvw7ln.cloudfront.net%2Fimages%2Fglobal%2F37%2F581%2FScorpion-Zero-All-Season-3-4-1505470086399.jpg&w=1920&q=75','SCORPION™ ZERO ALL SEASON is the new UHP SUV All Season product developed for premium and prestige OE Car Makers engineered to maximize the performances during all the seasons, in every driving condition, also on light snow-covered roads.The perfect choice for sporty SUV, developed together with the most important OE car makers in order to offer excellent performance on dry and wet and grant the perfect fit for every vehicle.The innovative compounds combined with the asymmetric and optimized pattern provide UHP performance during all seasons, assuring outstanding levels of safety and comfort and minimizing the noise level.',7),(179,'Ventus Prime4','https://www.hankooktire.com/uk/images/passenger-cars-tires/k135/hankook-tires-ventus-prime4-k135-left-01.png','Optimum driving control and a comfortable ride',8),(180,'Ventus S1 evo Z','https://www.hankooktire.com/uk/images/passenger-cars-tires/k129/hankook-tires-ventus-k129-left-01.png','Maximum performance with proven motorsport technology',8),(181,'Ventus S1 evo3','https://www.hankooktire.com/uk/images/passenger-cars-tires/k127/hankook-tires-k127-left-01.png','Powerful performance and superior handling for luxury vehicles',8),(182,'Ventus Prime 3','https://www.hankooktire.com/uk/images/passenger-cars-tires/k125/hankook-tires-ventus-prime3-k125-left-01.png','The perfect balance between performance, comfort and safety',8),(183,'Kinergy eco2','https://www.hankooktire.com/uk/images/passenger-cars-tires/k435/hankook-tires-Kinergy-eco2-left-01.png','The smart choice for driver and environment',8),(184,'Winter i*cept evo3','https://www.hankooktire.com/uk/images/passenger-cars-tires/w330/hankook-tires-winter-w330-left-01.png','Optimal driving in all winter conditions',8),(185,'Winter i*cept evo2','https://www.hankooktire.com/uk/images/passenger-cars-tires/w320/hankook-tires-winter-w320-left-01.png','Ultra-High-Performance tyre developed specifically for wintry road conditions',8),(186,'Winter i*cept RS2','https://www.hankooktire.com/uk/images/passenger-cars-tires/w452/hankook-tires-winter-icept-rs2-w452-left-01.png','Optimised pattern design for an excellent snow performance',8),(187,'Kinergy 4S2','https://www.hankooktire.com/uk/images/passenger-cars-tires/h750/hankook-tires-kinergy-h750-left-01.png','Just one, whatever the weather',8),(188,'Ventus S1 evo3 SUV','https://www.hankooktire.com/uk/images/passenger-cars-tires/k127a/hankook-tires-ventus-k127a-left-01.png','Powerful performance and superior handling for luxury SUVs',8),(189,'Dynapro HP2','https://www.hankooktire.com/uk/images/passenger-cars-tires/ra33/hankook-tires-dynapro-ra33-left-01.png','High performance tyre for luxury SUVs',8),(190,'Winter i*cept evo3 X','https://www.hankooktire.com/uk/images/passenger-cars-tires/w330a/hankook-tires-winter-w330a-left-01.png','An SUV tyre perfect for all winter conditions',8),(191,'Winter i*cept evo2 SUV','https://www.hankooktire.com/uk/images/passenger-cars-tires/w320a/hankook-tires-winter-w320a-left-01.png','Ultra winter performance tyre for 4x4s and SUVs',8),(192,'Dynapro MT2','https://www.hankooktire.com/uk/images/passenger-cars-tires/rt05/hankook-tires-dynapro-rt05-left-01.png','Tough tread and powerful all-terrain tyre',8),(193,'Kinergy 4S2 X','https://www.hankooktire.com/uk/images/passenger-cars-tires/h750a/hankook-tires-kinergy-h750a-left-01.png','Just one SUV tyre, whatever the weather',8),(194,'Dynapro AT2','https://www.hankooktire.com/uk/images/passenger-cars-tires/rf11/hankook-tires-dynapro-rf11-left-01.png','All-terrain SUV tyre with superior performance 365 days a year',8),(195,'FIREHAWK INDY 500','https://www.firestonetire.com/content/dam/consumer/fst/shared/tires/firehawk-indy-500/tilted.jpg','Feel the rush with every turn and lane change with the Firehawk INDY 500 tires. Inspired by our Firestone racing heritage, these ultra-high performance summer tires deliver impressive handling and corning in dry conditions, while the Proprietary Pulse Groove™ technology helps prevent hydroplaning*on wet surfaces.',9),(196,'WINTERFORCE 2','https://www.firestonetire.com/content/dam/consumer/fst/shared/tires/winterforce-2/tilted.jpg','Built to keep working through the winter, the Firestone Winterforce 2 tires provide a grip you can rely on in the harshest of winter conditions. With full depth tread features, these tires offer a long-lasting performance winter after winter',9),(197,'WINTERFORCE 2 UV','https://www.firestonetire.com/content/dam/consumer/fst/shared/tires/winterforce-2-uv/tilted.jpg','Designed with a special cold weather compound, open shoulder slots, and a unique tread design, the Firestone Winterforce 2 UV tires are ready to take on the winter conditions. With better grip for wintry weather than an all-season tire, they‚Äôll give your pickup truck, CUV, or SUV a long-lasting -performance winter after winter.',9),(198,'WINTERFORCE LT','https://www.firestonetire.com/content/dam/consumer/fst/shared/tires/winterforce-lt/tilted.jpg','With a patented tread to tame winter conditions, Firestone‚Äôs Winterforce LT tires helps deliver a comfortable and confident ride. In even the most unpredictable winter weather, they‚Äôll grip the road with solid traction.',9),(199,'WINTERFORCE CV','https://www.firestonetire.com/content/dam/consumer/fst/shared/tires/winterforce-cv/tilted.jpg','Equip your commercial light truck or van with tires built to get you through the winter. The Firestone Winterforce CV tires helps give you the traction you need to drive through wet, slushy, and snowy conditions. You can depend on this tire when the harshest conditions arrive.',9),(200,'CHAMPION FUEL FIGHTER','https://www.firestonetire.com/content/dam/consumer/fst/shared/tires/champion-fuel-fighter/tilted.jpg','For dependable, long lasting performance, the Champion Fuel Fighter tire is built with Fuel Fighter technology.* This technology helps with rolling resistance resulting in improved fuel economy. These touring tires will keep you rolling all year long with the capabilities to perform in wet, dry, and wintry conditions.',9),(201,'ALL SEASON ALL SEASON','https://www.firestonetire.com/content/dam/consumer/fst/shared/tires/all-season-all-season/tilted.jpg','Count on the Firestone All Season tire to keep you going. Built to last by a trustworthy brand, these tires offer all-season performance at a great value. With deep sipes and a unique tread design, they provide excellent traction and handling all year long. *55,000 Mile Limited Warranty (CUV Intended Sizes), 65,000 Mile Limited Warranty (All Other Sizes).',9),(202,'FIREHAWK AS','https://www.firestonetire.com/content/dam/consumer/fst/shared/tires/firehawk-as/tilted.jpg','Take control of the road with Firestone‚Äôs Firehawk AS performance all-season tires. Each tire is equipped with full-depth features for sporty performance, that can handle wet and snow-covered roads.',9),(203,'FIREHAWK AS','https://www.firestonetire.com/content/dam/consumer/fst/shared/tires/firehawk-as/tilted.jpg','Take control of the road with Firestone‚Äôs Firehawk AS performance all-season tires. Each tire is equipped with full-depth features for sporty performance, that can handle wet and snow-covered roads.',9),(204,'DESTINATION LE3','https://www.firestonetire.com/content/dam/consumer/fst/shared/tires/destination-le3/tilted.jpg','Come rain, shine, and even snow, the Firestone Destination LE3 tires keep you cruising no matter what the weather throws at them. Backed by a 70,000-mile limited warranty*, these all-season tires will keep your adventure going no matter the destination.',9),(205,'DESTINATION A/T2','https://www.firestonetire.com/content/dam/consumer/fst/shared/tires/destination-at2/tilted.jpg','Backed by a 55,000-mile limited mileage warranty**, the Firestone Destination A/T2 is built to kick up dirt. Whether it‚Äôs everyday driving or tackling off-road terrain, these tough tires help give you dependable traction and the ability to plow through tough terrains.',9),(206,'DESTINATION X/T','https://www.firestonetire.com/content/dam/consumer/fst/shared/tires/destination-xt/tilted.jpg','Kick up some dirt with the Firestone Destination X/T on- and off-road tires. Backed by our 50,000-mile limited mileage warranty* and heavy-duty toughness, you can depend on these tires to take you anywhere because tough terrains require and even tougher tire.',9),(207,'TRANSFORCE AT2','https://www.firestonetire.com/content/dam/consumer/fst/shared/tires/transforce-at2/tilted.jpg','The Firestone Transforce AT2 tires have a chip and tear-resistant compound so your commercial vehicle can take on rough conditions like gravel. Along with the ability to navigate difficult terrains, these tires were designed with deep tread features for more traction on wet and snowy roads to keep you moving forward.',9),(208,'TRANSFORCE HT2','https://www.firestonetire.com/content/dam/consumer/fst/shared/tires/transforce-ht2/tilted.jpg','Hit the highway with the tires built for it. The Firestone Transforce HT2 tires are designed to help give light trucks and commercial vehicles solid traction even on slick conditions and reduce the risk of hydroplaning when wet*. This tough tire is determined to get the job done every time in every season.',9),(209,'GRABBER X3','https://blobs.generaltire-tyres.com/www8/servlet/image/1455132/uncropped/0/395/5/grabber-x3-product-picture-1.png','General Tire’s new mud terrain tyre delivers outstanding off-road performance, coupled with good street manners. The GRABBER X3 offers aggressive styling and is engineered for durability, with innovative tread features.',10),(210,'GRABBER GT','https://blobs.generaltire-tyres.com/www8/servlet/image/1455040/uncropped/0/395/3/grabber-gt-product-picture-1.png','Developed for high-powered SUVs and off-road vehicles, the Grabber GT is not just really good to look at.',10),(211,'GRABBER GT PLUS','https://blobs.generaltire-tyres.com/www8/servlet/image/3646278/uncropped/0/395/2/general-tire--grabber-gt-plus--productpicture--30.png','General Tire‘s new SUV on-road summer product line designed to deliver a reliable performance with SUV dedicated robustness, outstanding wet grip and high mileage.',10),(212,'GRABBER TR','https://blobs.generaltire-tyres.com/www8/servlet/image/1455128/uncropped/0/395/3/grabber-tr-product-picture-1.png','Provides the off-road grip needed for gravel terrain as well as a smooth and comfortable drive on-road.',10),(213,'GRABBER HTS60','https://blobs.generaltire-tyres.com/www8/servlet/image/1455046/uncropped/0/395/3/grabber-hts60-product-picture-1.png','The tough highway terrain tyre with extremely well balanced product performance and significantly improved tread life over its predecessor.\n',10),(214,'SNOW GRABBER PLUS','https://blobs.generaltire-tyres.com/www8/servlet/image/2006208/uncropped/0/395/4/snow-grabber-plus-product-picture-1.png','The non-studded winter tyre line specifically designed for SUV / 4x4 vehicles takes you anywhere, even in the worst wintry conditions. Innovative traction features offer excellent grip on snow for an exceptional wintertime experience.',10),(215,'SNOW GRABBER','https://blobs.generaltire-tyres.com/www8/servlet/image/1455138/uncropped/0/395/3/snow-grabber-product-picture-1.png','Enhanced steering response, optimised snow traction and best braking performance on all surfaces',10),(216,'GRABBER A/S 365','https://blobs.generaltire-tyres.com/www8/servlet/image/2471168/uncropped/0/395/6/grabber-as-365-product-picture-1.png','Grab the next mile and ride with confidence. General Tire’s new SUV All Season tyre combines SUV specific toughness with reliable performance in all weather conditions.',10),(217,'GRABBER AT3','https://blobs.generaltire-tyres.com/www8/servlet/image/1455030/uncropped/0/395/3/grabber-at3-product-picture-1.png','The all-terrain tyre developed to meet the needs of SUV, pick-up truck and off-road vehicle drivers who want a combination of exceptional off-road capabilities and confident on-road manners.',10),(218,'GRABBER AT2','https://blobs.generaltire-tyres.com/www8/servlet/image/2220548/uncropped/0/395/5/grabber-at2-product-picture-1.png','Tortured by American off-road specialists under the toughest conditions, the GRABBER AT2 is the result of years of developments on the most varied grounds. Now also approved for the original equipment fitting to Mercedes Benz (G-Class).',10);
